---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalArticle from "../components/LegalArticle.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Diald Club"
  description="Privacy policy for the Diald Club coffee tracking app."
  bodyClass="legal-page"
>
  <LegalArticle title="Privacy Policy" updated="5 August 2026">
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how Diald Club ("the app", "we", "us")
      collects, uses, and protects your information when you use the Diald Club
      iOS app and website. By using Diald Club you agree to the practices
      described below.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Account information.</strong> To create and manage your account, we
        store your email address and, optionally, profile details such as your display
        name. You may sign in with email, Sign in with Apple, or Google Sign-In. If
        you choose Apple or Google, that provider processes the sign-in request and
        sends us authentication data that may include a provider account identifier,
        email address, and profile details you authorize it to share.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Your content.</strong> The beans, recipes, brew sessions, ratings,
        tasting notes, reminders, and related settings you add to the app are stored
        so they can sync across your devices.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Device tokens.</strong> If you enable push notifications we store
        an Apple Push Notification service token so we can send you alerts such as
        brew reminders.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Subscription information.</strong> We verify Apple's signed transaction
        information and store subscription status, expiration, and a lifetime extraction
        count associated with your Diald account. Deleting an individual extraction
        does not reduce that lifetime count.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>AI provider keys.</strong> If you use AI analysis, the API key for
        the lab you select is stored securely on your device in the iOS keychain and
        is used only to request analysis on your behalf. It is not sent to our servers.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        To provide the app's core features: tracking beans and brews, saving
        notes, syncing across devices, generating stats, and reminding you to
        brew.
      </li>
      <li>
        To send notifications you have opted into, such as brew reminders.
      </li>
      <li>To maintain, secure, and improve the service.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>AI analysis</h2>
    <p>
      AI analysis is optional. When you run an analysis, the brew data selected
      by your filters is sent from your device to the AI provider you chose,
      using your own API key. Provider use is governed by that provider's terms
      and privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>How your information is shared</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal information. Information is shared only in
      the following circumstances:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>With service providers.</strong> We use service providers to host
        and operate the app; Apple and Google for sign-in when selected; Apple for
        purchases and notifications; and your selected AI provider only when you choose
        to run AI analysis.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>When required by law.</strong> We may disclose information if required
        to do so by law or valid legal process.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain your information for as long as your account is active. You can
      delete beans, brews, notes, reminders, and other content from within the
      app at any time. The lifetime extraction count remains until you delete
      your account. When you delete your account, your associated personal data
      is removed from our systems.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information, including
      encrypted connections, database access controls, and Apple Keychain
      storage for AI provider keys. No method of transmission or storage is
      completely secure.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal
      information. To delete your account or make a request, contact us using
      the details below.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Diald Club is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly
      collect personal information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will
      revise the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of
      the app after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the updated
      policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at <a
        href="mailto:kyle@kylescudder.co.uk">kyle@kylescudder.co.uk</a
      >.
    </p>
  </LegalArticle>
</BaseLayout>
